{"full_name":"talebook/talebook","owner":"talebook","name":"talebook","url":"https://github.com/talebook/talebook","description":"一个简单好用的个人书库","homepage":"https://www.talebook.org","topics":[],"tag_pages":[],"language":"HTML","license":"BSD-2-Clause","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4410246?u=6e47f78c01687dc46dcb3d9ed09c5b7da7438b10&v=4","created_at":"2016-09-13T03:35:40Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T09:45:44Z","metrics":{"stars":5904,"forks":633,"watchers":37,"issues":520,"prs":552,"releases":25,"issues_open":112,"issues_closed":408,"prs_open":10,"prs_closed":118,"prs_merged":424,"discussions":0},"growth":{"day":{"stars":1,"forks":0,"base_day":"2026-11-13"}},"history":{"dates":["2026-11-10","2026-11-11","2026-11-12","2026-11-13","2026-11-14"],"stars":[5897,5901,5903,5903,5904],"forks":[633,633,633,633,633],"watchers":[null,37,37,37,37],"issues_open":[null,112,112,112,112],"prs_open":[null,10,10,10,10]},"boards":{},"same_owner":[],"issues":[{"number":875,"title":"测试 CODEX","comments":16,"created_at":"2026-07-18T02:49:28Z"},{"number":163,"title":"手机打开阅读页面出现转菊花","comments":16,"created_at":"2022-04-19T18:18:03Z"},{"number":404,"title":"批量导入epub书籍后，我没点自动更新元数据，也会自动更新书籍信息","comments":12,"created_at":"2024-05-21T10:49:17Z"},{"number":284,"title":"优化建议","comments":11,"created_at":"2023-03-10T02:34:09Z"},{"number":461,"title":"在线阅读一直转圈","comments":9,"created_at":"2024-12-05T02:23:23Z"},{"number":423,"title":"是否考虑支持听书功能","comments":8,"created_at":"2024-07-31T04:44:19Z"},{"number":407,"title":"账号激活邮件收不到","comments":8,"created_at":"2024-05-27T09:37:09Z"},{"number":94,"title":"静读天下app读取opds还是有问题","comments":8,"created_at":"2021-10-31T11:24:52Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"v26.10.18","tag":"v26.10.18","published_at":"2026-10-18T11:09:09Z","body":"# v26.10.18\r\n\r\n> 距 v26.10.10，共合并 4 个提交、1 个 PR。本版是一次修复版本，解决部分 NAS 上容器启动后无限重启的问题。\r\n\r\n## 🚀 修复\r\n\r\n- **NAS 上容器不再无限重启**（#1086）：飞牛 fnOS 等 NAS 的 Docker 以 umask `0002` 启动容器，v26.10.10 的在线升级执行器创建的运行时目录因此变成组可写，被自身的安全检查拒绝，导致容器反复重启。现在执行器统一使用 umask `0022` 并以 `0755` 创建运行时目录；之前崩溃循环遗留的空目录会自动收紧权限，非空、被符号链接替换或非 root 所有的目录仍会被拒绝。\r\n\r\n# ⚠️ 升级说明\r\n\r\n- 在 v26.10.10 上遇到容器反复重启的 NAS 用户，直接拉取新镜像重建容器即可，无需手动清理目录。\r\n- 可从 GHCR 拉取镜像：`ghcr.io/talebook/talebook:v26.10.18`；原 Docker Hub 地址继续保留。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n感谢反馈问题的用户，祝阅读与聆听愉快！🎉\r\n\r\n**完整变更**：https://github.com/talebook/talebook/compare/v26.10.10...v26.10.18\r\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}